#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:2
msgid "Connect MCP tools"
msgstr "连接 MCP 工具"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:4
msgid "Use :class:`~zett_agent.extensions.mcp.McpExtension` to connect tools supplied by Model Context Protocol servers. The model sees ordinary tool definitions; when it requests one, the extension calls the server and returns its result. Choose this for an existing MCP integration instead of rewriting its tools as local Python functions."
msgstr "使用\\ :class:`~zett_agent.extensions.mcp.McpExtension`\\ 连接由 Model Context Protocol 服务器提供的工具。模型看到的是普通的工具定义；当模型请求某个工具时，扩展会调用该服务器并返回结果。如果你已经有一套 MCP 集成，可以选择它，而不必把这些工具改写成本地 Python 函数。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:11
msgid "Connect a Streamable HTTP server"
msgstr "连接 Streamable HTTP 服务器"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:37
msgid "This is an opt-in network example: configure ``model`` using :doc:`providers`, and set the URL and token for a trusted server. Omit ``headers`` if the server does not require them. Headers are sent for the transport lifecycle and are excluded from the server object's ``repr``, but your application must still keep credentials out of logs and source control."
msgstr "这是一个需要主动启用的网络示例：用\\ :doc:`providers`\\ 配置 ``model``，并为受信任的服务器设置 URL 和令牌。如果服务器不要求 ``headers``，可以省略它。请求头会在传输的整个生命周期中发送，但不会出现在服务器对象的\\ ``repr``\\ 中；你的应用仍然必须避免凭据出现在日志和版本控制里。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:44
msgid "Launch a local stdio server"
msgstr "启动本地 stdio 服务器"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:64
msgid "Replace the path and arguments with a server you have installed. Commands and arguments are passed separately, not interpolated into a shell string. The process still runs with your application's permissions. Launch only trusted servers and restrict their filesystem, environment, and network access at the process or container boundary."
msgstr "请把路径和参数替换成你已经安装的服务器。命令和参数是分开传递的，不会被拼接进 shell 字符串。进程仍然以你应用的权限运行。只启动受信任的服务器，并在进程或容器边界上限制它们的文件系统、环境和网络访问。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:71
msgid "Use a configuration file"
msgstr "使用配置文件"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:73
msgid "mcp.json"
msgstr "mcp.json"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:89
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Load it with ``McpExtension(config_path=\"mcp.json\")``. Both ``servers`` and ``mcpServers`` are accepted root keys, but a file must use only one. HTTP entries can include ``headers``; stdio entries can include ``env`` and ``cwd``. Paths and commands in the file are your responsibility; do not assume they resolve relative to the configuration file. There is no automatic ``${VAR}`` interpolation for secrets; construct server definitions in Python when values come from environment variables."
msgstr "可以用\\ ``McpExtension(config_path=\"mcp.json\")``\\ 加载它。\\ ``servers``\\ 和\\ ``mcpServers``\\ 都是可接受的根键，但一个文件只能使用其中一个。HTTP 条目可以包含\\ ``headers``；stdio 条目可以包含\\ ``env``\\ 和\\ ``cwd``\\ 。文件中的路径和命令由你负责；不要假定它们相对于配置文件解析。密钥不会有自动的\\ ``${VAR}``\\ 替换；当取值来自环境变量时，请在 Python 中构造服务器定义。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:97
msgid "``McpExtension()`` looks for ``~/.zett/mcp.json``. Supplying an explicit ``servers`` list avoids that implicit lookup. A custom ``config_path`` and a server list can be combined; duplicate server names are rejected. A missing configuration file loads no servers, while malformed configuration raises an error when the extension is constructed."
msgstr "``McpExtension()``\\ 会查找\\ ``~/.zett/mcp.json``\\ 。传入显式的\\ ``servers``\\ 列表可以避免这种隐式查找。自定义的\\ ``config_path``\\ 可以和服务器列表一起使用；重复的服务器名称会被拒绝。配置文件不存在时不会加载任何服务器，而配置格式错误时会在构造扩展时抛出错误。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:103
msgid "By default (``strict_config=True``) one invalid server entry makes the whole file invalid, so a typo is never silently ignored. Pass ``McpExtension(strict_config=False)``, or ``McpConfiguration.from_file(path, strict=False)``, to skip invalid entries instead: each is logged and listed in ``McpConfiguration.skipped``, and the valid servers still load. A file that is not valid JSON or has no server mapping still raises."
msgstr "默认情况下（``strict_config=True``），只要有一个无效的服务器条目，整个文件就会失效，因此拼写错误绝不会被静默忽略。如果希望改为跳过无效条目，可以传入\\ ``McpExtension(strict_config=False)``\\ 或\\ ``McpConfiguration.from_file(path, strict=False)``：每个被跳过的条目都会写入日志并列入\\ ``McpConfiguration.skipped``，有效的服务器仍然会加载。如果文件不是有效的 JSON 或者没有服务器映射，仍然会抛出错误。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:110
msgid "The file is checked at the start of every request and re-read only when its modification time or size changed, so edits apply to the next request without restarting the application. A file that becomes invalid while the application is running is logged and the last valid server list stays in use."
msgstr "每个请求开始时都会检查该文件，只有在修改时间或大小发生变化时才会重新读取，因此修改会在下一个请求中生效，无需重启应用。如果文件在应用运行期间变得无效，会写入日志，并继续使用最后一次有效的服务器列表。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:116
msgid "Tool names and results"
msgstr "工具名称和结果"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:118
msgid "A server named ``catalog`` with a tool named ``search`` exposes ``catalog__search`` by default. Namespacing avoids collisions with local tools and other servers. ``namespace_tools=False`` keeps the original names, but you must then ensure every registered name is unique."
msgstr "名为\\ ``catalog``\\ 的服务器中有一个名为\\ ``search``\\ 的工具，默认会以\\ ``catalog__search``\\ 的形式暴露。使用命名空间可以避免与本地工具以及其他服务器冲突。\\ ``namespace_tools=False``\\ 会保留原始名称，但此时你必须确保每个已注册的名称都唯一。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:123
msgid "Server-provided input schemas describe the tools. Remote validation and your application policy remain important; MCP tools do not pass through the ``@tool`` function validator. If a result has ``structured_content``, it is returned as that structured value; otherwise content blocks are serialized as JSON data. Image blocks are not automatically promoted into typed vision messages. A remote ``is_error`` result becomes an ordinary tool failure the model can see."
msgstr "服务器提供的输入模式描述了这些工具。远程校验和你应用的策略仍然很重要；MCP 工具不会经过\\ ``@tool``\\ 函数校验器。如果结果带有\\ ``structured_content``，就会以该结构化值返回；否则内容块会被序列化成 JSON 数据。图像块不会被自动转成带类型的视觉消息。远程的\\ ``is_error``\\ 结果会变成模型可以看到的普通工具失败。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:132
msgid "Connections and failure"
msgstr "连接与失败"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:134
msgid "At the start of each request every server's tool list is discovered **concurrently**, so total latency is that of the slowest server instead of the sum. Tool lists are cached per server configuration for ``tools_cache_ttl`` seconds (default 300; ``0`` disables the cache). While the cache is warm a request starts no process and opens no socket: a server connects lazily the first time the model calls one of its tools, and only that server connects. Success, failure, cancellation, and :meth:`~zett_agent.agent.Agent.compact` passes close every connection the request opened."
msgstr "每个请求开始时，都会\\ **并发**\\ 发现所有服务器的工具列表，因此总延迟取决于最慢的服务器，而不是各服务器之和。工具列表会按服务器配置缓存\\ ``tools_cache_ttl``\\ 秒（默认 300；设为\\ ``0``\\ 表示禁用缓存）。缓存仍然有效时，请求不会启动任何进程，也不会打开任何套接字：服务器只有在模型第一次调用它的工具时才延迟连接，而且只有那个服务器会连接。请求无论是成功、失败、取消，还是执行\\ :meth:`~zett_agent.agent.Agent.compact`，都会关闭该请求打开的所有连接。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:143
msgid "A server that cannot connect or list its tools within ``connect_timeout`` seconds (default 30) is skipped. The model is told which server was unavailable, and the other servers keep working. A tool call that exceeds ``call_timeout`` seconds (default 300) fails with a ``TimeoutError`` the model can see; set either timeout to ``None`` to disable it. An ordinary failure during a tool call produces ``TOOL_FAILED`` and permits the model to continue. Choose which remote error text can be shown. The extension does not grant remote servers additional authorization."
msgstr "如果某个服务器无法在\\ ``connect_timeout``\\ 秒（默认 30）内连接或列出工具，它就会被跳过。模型会被告知哪个服务器不可用，其他服务器则继续正常工作。超过\\ ``call_timeout``\\ 秒（默认 300）的工具调用会失败，并抛出模型可以看到的\\ ``TimeoutError``；把任一超时设为\\ ``None``\\ 即可禁用它。工具调用过程中的普通失败会产生\\ ``TOOL_FAILED``，并允许模型继续。你可以选择哪些远程错误文本可以被显示。该扩展不会给远程服务器授予额外权限。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:152
msgid "Tool schemas are sent without ``title`` and ``$schema`` annotations, which server generators attach to every property and which only repeat the property name. Per-tool usage guidelines are omitted too: the system message already states that ``<server>__<tool>`` names belong to their server, so repeating it for every tool only costs prompt tokens. Property names, types, descriptions, and constraints are untouched."
msgstr "发送工具模式时不会包含\\ ``title``\\ 和\\ ``$schema``\\ 注解；服务器生成器会给每个属性都附上这些注解，而它们只是重复属性名。每个工具的使用准则也会被省略：系统消息已经说明\\ ``<server>__<tool>``\\ 形式的名称属于对应的服务器，因此为每个工具都重复一遍只会消耗提示词 token。属性的名称、类型、描述和约束都保持不变。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:159
msgid "Exposed tool names are limited to letters, digits, ``_`` and ``-`` and at most 64 characters, the intersection of what model providers accept; longer names are shortened with a stable hash. A tool whose exposed name is already registered is skipped with a warning instead of failing the request. Servers that repeat a pagination cursor or return more than 100 pages are treated as unavailable."
msgstr "暴露的工具名称只能包含字母、数字、``_``\\ 和\\ ``-``，并且最多 64 个字符，这是各模型提供商接受范围的交集；更长的名称会用稳定哈希缩短。如果某个工具的暴露名称已经被注册，它会被跳过并给出警告，而不会让请求失败。如果服务器重复返回同一个分页游标，或者返回超过 100 页，就会被视为不可用。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:167
msgid "Verify the integration offline"
msgstr "离线验证集成"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:173
msgid "Run ``uv run python docs/_examples/mcp_tools.py`` from a checkout:"
msgstr "在源码检出目录中运行\\ ``uv run python docs/_examples/mcp_tools.py``："

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:180
msgid "The :download:`complete example <../_examples/mcp_tools.py>` supplies an in-memory MCP client through ``client_factory``. It verifies registration, dispatch, structured results, and transport cleanup without starting a server."
msgstr ":download:`完整示例 <../_examples/mcp_tools.py>`\\ 通过\\ ``client_factory``\\ 提供了一个内存中的 MCP 客户端。它无需启动服务器，就能验证注册、分发、结构化结果和传输清理。"

#: ../../learn/mcp.rst:184
msgid "Next: :doc:`tools` for local tool behavior, or :doc:`../extending/server-tools` for tools executed by a model provider rather than an MCP server."
msgstr "下一步：:doc:`tools`\\ 介绍本地工具的行为，或者看\\ :doc:`../extending/server-tools`，了解由模型提供商而非 MCP 服务器执行的工具。"

